WEBVTT

00:07:58.349 --> 00:08:01.352
that creates a sense of passion
or commitment that seems insane

00:08:01.352 --> 00:08:03.103
or irrational to the outsider.

00:08:03.812 --> 00:08:06.565
And the second is
that they adopt the form of

00:08:06.565 --> 00:08:10.778
and use the tools of the dominant
organizations of their day.

00:08:10.819 --> 00:08:12.404
From the church

00:08:12.446 --> 00:08:14.073
to the corporation

00:08:14.114 --> 00:08:16.242
to the social media network

00:08:16.242 --> 00:08:19.328
to our subject for today, the metaverse.

00:08:21.288 --> 00:08:26.293
So what happens when you mix
billions of people looking for meaning,

00:08:26.293 --> 00:08:28.796
safety and security

00:08:28.837 --> 00:08:31.173
with widespread virtual worlds,